    onto:hasExperimentSetup "Split all data over two Sun-Fire-880 machines (8x sparcv9 CPU, 1050 Mhz, 16GB RAM) running SunOS 5.10. The SPARQL endpoints were provided using Virtuoso Server 5.0.3 with an allowed memory usage of 8 GB . Note that, although we use only two physical servers, there were five logical SPARQL endpoints. DARQ was running on Sun Java 1.6.0 on a Linux system with Intel Core Duo CPUs, 2.13 GHz and 4GB RAM. The machines were connected over a standard 100Mbit network connection." ;
